{"unit_id":"shuxi-2789__dsh-whale-memory#feature-1","repo":"shuxi-2789/dsh-whale-memory","commit":"b751899bffdf045d077a7eec31fc533da6ec1f81","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-whale-memory 的功能「新会话灵魂快照」：汇集记忆回溯模块、根卷、最新归档备忘录和日记片段，按配置预算生成可用于唤醒新会话的文本。通过 whale_wake 工具触发，可选传入近期聊天 JSON 生成补偿块。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:276-299","vendor/brain/scripts/wake-snapshot.mjs:61-85"]}
